IMPORTANT: the game requires you to use a controler in order to control the character properly. 

The release is currently only semi-playable as it lacks a winning/losing game state. There are methods that get called, but they are currently unimplemented. 
Additionally, the game currently requires a controller in order to play properly. 

All of these will be fixed in the next update.

The games lighting is currently pretty simple. I plan to do work to light the scene in a more interesting way, maybe by using scrolling background elements. But I could not implement it in time for this progress update. 

The lighting was much more interesting in a prior update, which can be seen in this footage of an early version:
https://youtu.be/rlcNe7wjwEs?t=22

but I had to rearrange some stuff when adding the black hole, which caused this effect to no longer be possible, and I didn't hav enough time to rework it.
I plan to implement something simular in the final version.

